	(text "Solar-powered window: U401A cold / U401B hot / U401C shared supply.\n100k cell NTC; nominal 4.685...40.195 C. Open or short inhibits charging.\nTLV7032 has 10mV typical / 25mV maximum hysteresis; see updated analysis.\nTPS3839 supervisor and series hardware interlock retained; MCU can inhibit only."
